  data: {
    LLM: "1. Turn: A player plays a card from their hand.\n2. Validation: God announces if the card is 'Legal' or 'Illegal'.\n3. Legal Play: The card is placed on the 'Main Line' (the horizontal row).\n4. Illegal Play: The card is placed on a 'Sideline' (vertically beneath the last legal card), and the player must draw a penalty card.\n5. Induction: Players observe the pattern of the Main Line vs. the Sidelines to guess the secret rule.",
    Player: "1. Turn: A player plays a card from their hand.\n2. Validation: God announces if the card is 'Legal' or 'Illegal'.\n3. Legal Play: The card is placed on the 'Main Line' (the horizontal row).\n4. Illegal Play: The card is placed on a 'Sideline' (vertically beneath the last legal card), and the player must draw a penalty card.\n5. Induction: Players observe the pattern of the Main Line vs. the Sidelines to guess the secret rule.",
    objective: 'For players: Empty your hand by playing legal cards. For God: Create a rule that is neither too simple to guess immediately nor too complex to ever be discovered.',
